      "en": "Then he brought me to the inner court of the Lord’s house. Right there[NOTE:1] at the entrance to the Lord’s temple, between the porch and the altar,[NOTE:2] were about 25[NOTE:3] men with their backs to the Lord’s temple,[NOTE:4] facing east—they were worshiping the sun[NOTE:5] toward the east!",
